  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Inside Lu Wei Yin’s reforming dream, after Fang Yuan shows filial care that heals an old lady, a rank two accumulate virtue Gu appears in his aperture. According to Virtue true inheritance, this Gu refines and appears on its own when he does good deeds and acts kindly. Greater accumulation of kindness raises the rank of the Gu that is refined. It is one of the core foundations of that true inheritance. Its greatest stated use is to change cultivation aptitude toward the Righteous Virtue Physique, described as only inferior to the ten extreme physiques and without their flaws.",
        "chapters": [
          1542
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lu_wei_yin",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "inh_virtue_true_inheritance",
          "sys_righteous_virtue_physique"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When a Shu clan elder attacks him over his secret aptitude rise, Fang Yuan fights past his limit and uses the mortal killer move Virtuous Submission. The move uses up all of his accumulate virtue Gu. The elder takes no injuries, then cries, kneels, and begs forgiveness for attacking someone so virtuous.",
        "chapters": [
          1542
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "full-gu-expenditure",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "move_virtuous_submission"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In a later year-long defensive battle in the same dream life, he saves countless mortals and Gu Masters, refines countless accumulate virtue Gu, and his reputation soars.",
        "chapters": [
          1542
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "full-gu-expenditure",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan receives Southern Border’s Paradise Earth true inheritance, its human path portion is the Virtue true inheritance he had already met in that dream. The core Immortal Gu is accumulate virtue Gu. As long as he does good deeds and acts kindly, it continues to refine itself, and greater kindness raises the rank refined. Its most useful stated effect is to modify his physique into the Righteous Virtue Physique.",
        "chapters": [
          2087
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paradise-earth-portion",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_southern_border",
          "inh_paradise_earth_true_inheritance",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The refinement method refines accumulate virtue Gu in the person’s body through acts of righteousness and kindness. Fang Yuan treats that as a human body Gu refinement method, or rather a human path Gu refinement method, and notes similarity to Qing Chou’s hatred Gu refinement.",
        "chapters": [
          2087
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paradise-earth-portion",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_qing_chou"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
